{"id": "t015-053", "text": "Long chat with Kasia on the phone. She's sorted most of the Lyon move, the removal firm's booked for March 2nd 2027 and her boyfriend Luca is driving the car down with the cat a week later. The new job is a big step up, she'll be running the paediatric ward, and she admitted she's a bit terrified about the French. I said I'd send her my old Duolingo tips. Should ring her after the first week to see how it's going.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Lyon move", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 2nd 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "boyfriend", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving the car down", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week later", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "running the paediatric ward", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit terrified about the French", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring her after the first week to see how it's going", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the first week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t015-054", "text": "Ellie's wedding date is set!! Sept 18 2027 in Bali obvs. Save the date coming. Her brother is doing the flights spreadsheet for everyone", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ellie", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sept 18 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t015-055", "text": "bumped into Julien at the station, he's off to Paris for his gran's 90th this weekend. Svetlana's not going, too far along to travel", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Paris", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "gran", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "90th", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Svetlana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "too far along to travel", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t015-056", "text": "Zoe landed fine. Says Madrid's boiling and the flat is lovely. Pedro already got her a coffee machine so scrap that, maybe plants?", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "plants", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t015-057", "text": "Dentist Thurs 4pm. Car insurance due 3/1", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Dentist", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thurs 4pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Car insurance due", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "3/1", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t015-058", "text": "Helen asked about her daughter Ellie's wedding, wants to know if I'm going to Bali. Haven't decided yet", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Helen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ellie", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t015-059", "text": "Seo-yeon's parents left yesterday. She said the Lakes were a hit but her dad got a chest infection in Edinburgh and they had to cut it short. Remind me to ask how he's doing", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Seo-yeon", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "chest infection", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how he's doing", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after", "owner": "r2", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t015-060", "text": "Spoke to Lars, Rohan and Amir about a lads' trip. Lars wants Iceland, Rohan wants Lisbon, Amir can't do anything before March 2027 because of his exams. Rohan's going to do a poll. I'm keeping my diary free for the last week of March, and need to check my passport expiry date because I think it runs out 2027 too.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lars", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amir", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lads' trip", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lars", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amir", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before March 2027"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "exams", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the last week of March"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check my passport expiry date", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "2027"}]}
